<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Continental AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Continental AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Continental AG, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	 ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	32.00 DEM    3.00 DEM     10.41 PCT    10.57 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	34.00 DEM    2.20 DEM     14.20 PCT    14.41 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	36.00 DEM    1.60 DEM     18.61 PCT    19.81 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-20.JAN.98   PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  31.70 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
